      "content": "# VortexScale Quick Start\n\n## Prerequisites\nEnsure Docker, AWS CLI (v1+), and a valid API key are installed.\n\n## Initialize Deployment\nAuthenticate with your key: `vortex login --key <YOUR_API_KEY>`\nCreate a project structure: `vortex init --project <PROJECT_NAME>`\n\n## Deploy to Production\nVerify local config, then execute: `vortex deploy --env prod`\nTools will auto-detect stack changes and push to the specified region.\n\n## Troubleshooting\nCheck logs immediately: `vortex logs --project <PROJECT_NAME>`\nFor network issues, verify VPC peering status in AWS Console before retrying.",
